  The save glyph for the media notification.

  A tray-and-arrow rather than a plus or a heart: what the button does is put a
  file on the device, and the download arrow is the one symbol Android users
  already read that way. Same flat white on transparent at 24dp as the transport
  set beside it — see spool_ic_play.xml for why these are the module's own.
-->
